Typical Instruments: Custom Game Boy DMG-01 consoles (running LSDJ), 1990s Fender Stratocasters, Tenor Saxophone, Trombone, Trumpet, Steel Pans, Yamaha VSS-30 samplers, Tascam 424 Portastudio (used on stage for manual tape-flutter scratching), and Cowbells.

